# Run ../Generate-SampleTokens.ps1 and select the dev environment in Visual Studio.
# Select dev environment here

### List transfers as viewer - expected 200
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### Inspect transfer as viewer - expected 200
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}

### Create standard transfer as cashier - expected 200
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1000 }

### Higher-limit transfer as cashier - expected 403
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1001 }

### Higher-limit transfer as supervisor - expected 200
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 2000 }

### Viewer has the scope but cannot create transfers - expected 403
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{viewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100 }

### Supervisor has user permissions but lacks the transfers scope - expected 403
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{noScopeToken}}

### Reconcile as service with placeholder subject and no roles - expected 200
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### User issuer is not accepted by the service scheme - expected 401
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### Service issuer is not accepted by the user scheme - expected 401
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### Missing authentication - expected 401
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers



### Export task names for IAM - expected 200
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/infrastructure/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}

### Business audience is not accepted by infrastructure - expected 401
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/infrastructure/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}

### User issuer cannot export tasks - expected 401
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/infrastructure/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### Task export requires authentication - expected 401
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/infrastructure/tasks


### Infrastructure token lacks the task-export scope - expected 403
GET {{Api1_HostAddress}}/infrastructure/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{iamNoScopeToken}}

### Infrastructure audience is not accepted by reconciliation - expected 401
POST {{Api1_HostAddress}}/transfers/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{iamToken}}
